  "prefLabel": "Puc 202.10 Motion",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 202.10 “Motion” means a request for an order or ruling by the commission directing some act to be done in favor of the party making the motion, and shall include a statement of justification or reasons for the request.\n\nSource. #14184, eff 1-24-25",
